{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月も今日で終わりですね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月は28日までしかないんですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5th製作期間やliveなどなど\n一日フル活動していることが多かったので\nあっという間でした......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のbirthday liveのオープニング映像、私が担当させていただきましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じのケーキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ大きくて、可愛いかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるで私のお誕生会みたい(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このケーキリアルに私が買ってきたのですが、１万円超えてて驚きました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"liveでこの映像が流れている最中「れいかだーれいかだー」て声が聞こえて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな最近でしたが、\n3月発売の『ＵＴＢ』で初単独グラビアをさせていただきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで撮影していただきましたが......ちょっと恥ずかしかった(/-＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてで不安もあったけれど\nどれも綺麗に撮ってくださったので出来上がりが楽しみ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテンでもない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のメンバーでもない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素の桜井玲香が写っていると思うので、是非見ていただければ嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私ですが、昨日も新鮮な現場に行ってお仕事してきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また解禁になったらお話しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からの3月もいい月になりますよーに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/02/28/4362441/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}